WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A demonstration of an educational website about programming languages and paradigms.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The main page presents basic information about the topic.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The About page contains information about the history and main concepts.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The Resources section contains a glossary and useful sources.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.100
The website also contains comparison tables of programming languages.